{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leonardo\u2019s Island</strong> lets you design and build ships, then test them in regattas and naval battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have different play modes: Sail solo in <i>Around the Island</i>, or compete online in <i>Battles</i> and <i>Regattas</i> with other players. If you prefer to play only with friends, <i>Steam Friends</i> lets you challenge them in races and naval combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/45e19a0ce086c5ecdefb7071d0d54773.poster.avif?t=1770846607\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/45e19a0ce086c5ecdefb7071d0d54773.webm?t=1770846607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/45e19a0ce086c5ecdefb7071d0d54773.mp4?t=1770846607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your ships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Customize your ship\u2019s shape, combine sails and weapons to match your style. Each hull changes how you sail. Each new sail delivers new speed and freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/0f812bd0125009678656ffeed101d023.poster.avif?t=1770846607\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/0f812bd0125009678656ffeed101d023.webm?t=1770846607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/0f812bd0125009678656ffeed101d023.mp4?t=1770846607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Regattas or Battles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every voyage brings gold and experience \u2014 or an inglorious end at the bottom of the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/5e9949aa73225f7b55ba5f696c207b7e.poster.avif?t=1770846607\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/5e9949aa73225f7b55ba5f696c207b7e.webm?t=1770846607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/5e9949aa73225f7b55ba5f696c207b7e.mp4?t=1770846607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow your ships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock powerful cannons, reduce their weight, boost their damage. Become the terror of the local seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/41e3838468691ac110bae5e973adaa07.poster.avif?t=1770846607\" width=1170 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/41e3838468691ac110bae5e973adaa07.webm?t=1770846607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/41e3838468691ac110bae5e973adaa07.mp4?t=1770846607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cannonballs, bombs, chain shot, grapeshot \u2014 and your deadly aim.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Break their masts, burn their decks, and plunder their gold from the wreckage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/c54b28faae75767175cb828a441b2e38.poster.avif?t=1770846607\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/c54b28faae75767175cb828a441b2e38.webm?t=1770846607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/c54b28faae75767175cb828a441b2e38.mp4?t=1770846607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1449590?t=1770846607","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/e92c49eee9fc65be7b35bed8a29170929c989b27/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770846607","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/8aefd97eecb50b2103b41534c67b56b40484564a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770846607","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/8aefd97eecb50b2103b41534c67b56b40484564a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770846607","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3162710,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leonardo\u2019s Island</strong> lets you design and build ships, then test them in regattas and naval battles.</p><p cl