 or Battles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every voyage brings gold and experience \u2014 or an inglorious end at the bottom of the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/5e9949aa73225f7b55ba5f696c207b7e.poster.avif?t=1770846607\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/5e9949aa73225f7b55ba5f696c207b7e.webm?t=1770846607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/5e9949aa73225f7b55ba5f696c207b7e.mp4?t=1770846607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow your ships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock powerful cannons, reduce their weight, boost their damage. Become the terror of the local seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/41e3838468691ac110bae5e973adaa07.poster.avif?t=1770846607\" width=1170 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/41e3838468691ac110bae5e973adaa07.webm?t=1770846607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449590/extras/41e3838468691ac110bae5e973adaa07.mp4?t=1770846607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cannonballs, bombs, chain shot, grapeshot \u2014 and your deadly aim.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Break their masts, burn their decks, and plunder their gold from the wreckage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></